 rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ISFJ 守衛者</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%98%9f%e5%ba%a7%e9%81%8b%e7%a8%8b/intp-intp%e6%80%a7%e6%a0%bc-16%e5%9e%8b%e4%ba%ba%e6%a0%bc-mbti-cplt1-1679951/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">INTP 邏輯學家</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%98%9f%e5%ba%a7%e9%81%8b%e7%a8%8b/infp-infp%e6%80%a7%e6%a0%bc-16%e5%9e%8b%e4%ba%ba%e6%a0%bc-mbti-cplt1-1680035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">INFP 調停者</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>資料來源：<a href=\"https://www.16personalities.com/tw/isfp-%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">16型人格</a></p>\n<h2>新假期編輯推薦：INFP女ESTJ男｜意思差別、MBTI測試性格特質、愛情觀及優缺點</h2>\n<p>INFP女ESTJ男 可能會在溝通和價值觀上遇到一些衝突。INFP女性可能會感到被ESTJ男性的強勢和事務導向所壓倒，而ESTJ男性可能會覺得INFP女性過於情感化和不夠實際。然而，如果他們能夠互相理解和尊重對方的差異，這對夫妻也可以彼此補充和成長。<br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/mbti/infp%e5%a5%b3estj%e7%94%b7-16%e5%9e%8b%e4%ba%ba%e6%a0%bc-mbti-cplt1-1724783/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:43:50.417997+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2232,"images":0,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:33.000661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:37:27.461724+00:00","content_hash":"5d265f1f0c8823bc3782112e97209256d9356c323098b467900a372abcccf8f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}